# One line ending in the repository, whatever the machine checking it out.
#
# `#!/usr/bin/env bash` followed by a CR fails with `bad interpreter`, which names the
# interpreter and not the real problem. The hooks are the reason this file exists.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
